{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10418","headline":"宋中遇陈二 · 高适","name":"宋中遇陈二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常忝鲍叔义，所期王佐才。\n如何守苦节，独此无良媒。\n离别十年外，飘颻千里来。\n安知罢官後，惟见柴门开。\n穷巷隐东郭，高堂咏南陔。\n篱根长花草，井上生莓苔。\n伊昔望霄汉，於今倦蒿莱。\n男儿命未达，且尽手中桮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}